<title>NETHERLANDS: HOCKEY-RESULTS IN MEN'S FOUR-NATIONS TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-RESULTS IN MEN'S FOUR-NATIONS TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in a men's four-nations</p>
<p>hockey tournament on Saturday:</p>
<p>Pakistan beat South Africa 5-2 (halftime 2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Pakistan - Danish Kaleem 10, Kamran Ashraf 32 and 42,</p>
<p>Muhammad Usman 39, Muhammad Khalid Junior 69.</p>
<p>South Africa - Grant Fulton 65 (penalty), Greg Nicol 67</p>
<p>Netherlands beat England 5-0 (halftime 3-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Japp Derk Buma 4, 10, 59, Bram Lomans 18, 54</p>
</text>
